        "original_id": "7ca026c7-458a-5e89-add3-0d4e0574c2fb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Monkey on My Back\", \"Pump\", \"Same Old Song and Dance\"\n- People: Steven Tyler, Joe Perry\n- Organizations: Aerosmith\n- Roles: lead singer, lead guitarist, guitarist\n- Concepts: \"Demon of Screamin'\", vocal range\n\nFacts:\n- Aerosmith is an American hard rock band.\n- \"Monkey on My Back\" is a song by Aerosmith.\n- Steven Tyler was Aerosmith's lead singer, and Joe Perry was Aerosmith's lead guitarist.\n- Steven Tyler and Joe Perry wrote \"Monkey on My Back\".\n- \"Monkey on My Back\" was released on Aerosmith's 1989 album \"Pump\".\n- Steven Tyler is known as the \"Demon of Screamin'\" because of his high screams and wide vocal range.\n- Steven Tyler and Joe Perry wrote \"Same Old Song and Dance\", and Joe Perry is identified there as a guitarist.",
